><main class=\"community-detail-page\"><section class=\"community-detail-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"community-title\"><div class=\"community-detail-hero-content\"><a class=\"community-back-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span> All communities</a><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">Fox Cities communities / <!-- -->01</p><h1 id=\"community-title\">Appleton</h1><p class=\"community-detail-hero-copy\">Explore a Fox Cities community with a wide range of neighborhoods, everyday conveniences, and a strong sense of local connection.</p><div class=\"community-detail-hero-actions\"><a href=\"#buyers-sellers-guides\" class=\"btn btn--light\">Get the Buyer’s &amp; Seller’s Guides</a></div></div><figure class=\"community-hero-figure\"><div class=\"community-detail-hero-media\"><img alt=\"East College Avenue in Appleton, Wisconsin.\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"community-detail-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent\" src=\"/communities/appleton.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"community-image-credit\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Appleton%20June%202026%20077%20(E.%20College%20Avenue).jpg\">Appleton June 2026 077 (E. College Avenue).jpg</a> — Photo by <span>Michael Barera</span> / Wikimedia Commons / <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"license\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a><span class=\"community-image-credit-changes\">Displayed cropped to fit the layout.</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"community-overview-title\"><div><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">01 — Local perspective</p><h2 id=\"community-overview-title\">Get to know <!-- -->Appleton<!-- -->.</h2></div><div class=\"community-detail-overview-copy\"><p>Appleton offers a variety of ways to feel at home—from established residential streets and walkable areas to newer opportunities close to the places people use every day. The right fit comes down to your priorities, timing, and the kind of daily rhythm you want.</p></div></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-market\" aria-labelledby=\"community-market-title\"><div class=\"community-detail-section-heading\"><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">02 — Market context</p><h2 id=\"community-market-title\">Appleton<!-- -->, by the numbers.</h2><p class=\"community-detail-section-copy\">Verified market figures will be added here. Until then, all statistics below are clearly marked as placeholders.</p></div><dl class=\"community-stat-grid\"><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Median sale price</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Average days on market</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Active listings</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Average price per sq. ft.</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Year-over-year trend</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-properties\" aria-labelledby=\"community-properties-title\"><div class=\"community-detail-section-heading\"><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">03 — Properties</p><h2 id=\"community-properties-title\">A closer look at <!-- -->Appleton<!-- -->.</h2><p class=\"community-detail-section-copy\">Approved property photography will be added here. These placeholders do not represent active listings.</p></div><div class=\"community-property-grid\"><figure class=\"community-gallery-figure\"><div class=\"community-property-media\"><div class=\"community-media-placeholder\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"community-placeholder-mark\">L</span><p>Appleton property photo 01</p><span class=\"community-placeholder-note\">Image coming soon</span></div></div></figure><figure class=\"community-gallery-figure\"><div class=\"community-property-media\"><div class=\"community-media-placeholder\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"community-placeholder-mark\">L</span><p>Appleton property photo 02</p><span class=\"community-placeholder-note\">Image coming soon</span></div></div></figure><figure class=\"community-gallery-figure\"><div class=\"community-property-media\"><div class=\"community-media-placeholder\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"community-placeholder-mark\">L</span><p>Appleton property photo 03</p><span class=\"community-placeholder-note\">Image coming soon</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section id=\"buyers-sellers-guides\" class=\"guides-lead-magnet\" aria-labelledby=\"guides-lead-magnet-title\"><div class=\"guides-lead-magnet-content\"><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-eyebrow\">Plan your next chapter</p><h2 id=\"guides-lead-magnet-title\">Get the Buyer’s &amp; Seller’s Guides</h2><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-description\">Submit the form and we’ll send you practical guides to help you make your next move with confidence.</p><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-delivery\">After submitting, you’ll see a thank-you message here and receive the guides by email.</p></div><div class=\"guides-lead-magnet-form\"><iframe src=\"https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;border-radius:8px\" id=\"inline-c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-layout=\"{&#x27;id&#x27;:&#x27;INLINE&#x27;}\" data-trigger-type=\"alwaysShow\" data-trigger-value=\"\" data-activation-type=\"alwaysActivated\" data-activation-value=\"\" data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\" data-deactivation-value=\"\" data-form-name=\"Buyer&#x27;s and Seller&#x27;s Guide\" data-height=\"989\" data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-form-id=\"c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-cookie-consent=\"true\" data-cookie-consent-provider=\"auto\" title=\"Buyer&#x27;s and Seller&#x27;s Guide\"></iframe></div></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-final\" aria-labelledby=\"community-final-title\"><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">Your next chapter</p><h2 id=\"community-final-title\">Let’s talk about your next move in Appleton.</h2><p class=\"community-detail-section-copy\">Buying, selling, or simply exploring? Talk with the Lathrop Team about your priorities and next steps.</p><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/contact\">Talk through your move</a></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-head